{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_116_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_116","textTraditional":"一、二年，春王二月壬子，宋華元帥師及鄭公子歸生帥師戰于大棘。宋師敗績，獲宋華元。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_116_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_116","textTraditional":"二、秦師伐晉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_116_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_116","textTraditional":"三、夏，晉人、宋人、衞人、陳人侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_116_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_116","textTraditional":"四、秋九月乙丑，晉趙盾弒其君夷獔。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_116_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_116","textTraditional":"五、冬十月乙亥，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}